====Usage notes====
This figurative sense of "OCD" as a synonym for "fastidious" or "perfectionistic" has been in widespread usage; however, it is seen as offensive as it potentially trivializes the actual condition known as obsessive-compulsive disorder, which is considered a very serious mental disorder, and this trivialization is oppressive to individuals who have it.

